message_template.body:
Hello,

We would like to connect {{app_name}} to your Workday tenant with OAuth 2.0. Could you register an API client (Register API Client) with:
- Client name: {{app_name}}
- Grant type: Authorization Code Grant
- Access token type: Bearer
- Redirection URI: {{redirect_uri}}
- Scopes (functional areas): {{scopes}}

Please also add the needed domain security policies for the authorizing account and send us the client ID, client secret, and your tenant's authorize, token and REST endpoints.

Thank you,
{{developer_name}}
